 "notes": "Own row and Finkelstein et al. 1997 p. 721 describe scattered sherds 'with no building remains'; no pool, pit or grave at the unit. 'No building remains' and 'Distance to water source: 3.80 km' do not name a feature class, so no explicit absence is recorded. The second entry on p. 721 (18-14/18/01) is S1848: fences, terraces, pens only. S1912 and S1922 rows are the cave/cistern themselves, so their row periods (Byz/Ott only) give L."
